<title>POLAND: DEBICA NOV NET FALLS TO PLN 1.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>DEBICA NOV NET FALLS TO PLN 1.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results November</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.11 vs   3.10</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.23 vs   3.14</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.61 vs   3.85</p>
<p> Sales		   52.10 vs  44.95</p>
<p>JANUARY-NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	    35.84 vs  42.16</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	64.09 vs  59.79</p>
<p> Operating profit    43.71 vs  68.23</p>
<p> Sales		  559.72 vs 457.48</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish tyre maker is Firma Oponiarska</p>
<p>Debica SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
